From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: virtudude <virtudude@protonmail.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 23:24:37 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] dt-bindings: embedded-controller: add HP OmniBook Ultra 14 EC

The Snapdragon X2-based HP OmniBook Ultra Laptop 14-kg0xxx has an
embedded controller on I2C at address 0x76. It runs the fan and the
keyboard backlight, drives the mute LEDs, reports hotkeys, and reports
the fan speed and the temperatures of its thermistors, which can serve
as thermal sensors. The interrupt is optional: the EC answers commands
without it.

